  "forestLongDescription": "FOREST WAS DEVELOPED TO SUPPORT THE DIGITALIZATION AND MONITORING OF FOREST AREAS. THE APPLICATION COMBINES SENSOR TECHNOLOGY, GEOLOCATION, AND REAL-TIME DATA INTO A CENTRALIZED PLATFORM. THROUGH AN INTERACTIVE MAP, USERS CAN PLACE, MANAGE, AND MONITOR SENSORS ACROSS THE FOREST WHILE ACCESSING INFORMATION SUCH AS TEMPERATURE, BATTERY STATUS, AND GPS LOCATION. IN ADDITION, THE SYSTEM ENABLES THE MONITORING OF DESIGNATED AREAS WHERE CAMERAS TRACK CURRENT VISITOR ACTIVITY. BY INTEGRATING GOOGLE MAPS, WEATHER DATA, AND SENSOR INFORMATION, FOREST PROVIDES A COMPREHENSIVE TOOL FOR ANALYZING AND MANAGING MODERN FOREST ENVIRONMENTS.",

